  "description": "When you’re a short track speed skater, every second counts. But despite training 24-7, Hoonjae is no match for his arch rival Seojoon. What’s more, with practice taking up all his time, Hoonjae hasn’t been able to explore life’s pleasures - like girls, for instance. One night, he decides to take the plunge and lose his virginity. Once he does, he starts flying across the ice! Plus, all the gorgeous girls around the rink suddenly see Hoonjae in a different light. Soon enough, things begin to get hot and steamy off the ice…\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
